    "rich_text_QNTdcA": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Q7drgC": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "<strong>Conclusion: A Small Purchase, Big Impact</strong>",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_Ff8GJk": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After a decade of working with cats, I can confidently say a cat pop up tent or cat tube is one of the most useful enrichment products you can buy. It ticks every box: safe, portable, affordable, and loved by cats of all ages.</p><p>The Snarky Pets Cat Tube, in particular, combines the portability of a tent with the playful design of a tunnel—perfect for active cats who love to hide and dash, as well as shy cats who just need a cozy retreat.</p><p>If your cat craves stimulation, privacy, or a safe way to explore new environments, this is a simple investment that pays off in happy purrs, healthier play, and more restful naps.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Q7drgC",
        "text_Ff8GJk"
      ],
